      "statusChangeNewStatus": "needs more information",
      "value": "Thanks for your report. We are currently unable to reproduce this problem when following these steps:\n\n1. Add a contact receiver to a game object and configure it to be a box with a size.\n\n2. Convert this game object to a prefab.\n\n3. Right click on the prefab and export it as a `.unitypackage` file.\n\n4. In a different SDK project, import the Unity package.\n\nWhen following these steps, as the package is imported, the Size property (as well as all other values) seem to come in as expected, with their values still set.\n\nPlease can you provide the set of steps you're following to trigger this issue to help us investigate further? Thanks very much.",
